<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">mind-spike</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Mind Spike</ansi> spell drives a focused psionic lance directly into the
target's consciousness, bypassing physical armor entirely. The spike
tears through mental defenses rather than bodily ones — effective
against foes whose minds are less guarded than their bodies.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast mind-spike [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 2
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 20
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower and mental fortitude resist
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Direct psionic damage to a single target

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
